%%body
{
  Poking the curious wooden construct, it teetered along without a care in the world, they were curious indeed.

    @ Nori "Why now, I wonder?"

  You wonder as well, maybe the world had enough mana to sustain them?

    @ Nori "It isn't quite stable yet, nor should it have the capacity to support as many signatures as I'm finding."

  Maybe something else is out there that isn't being seen then.

    @ Nori "There are blind spots, I'll need you to be my eyes on the ground."

  It's what you've been doing since you got to Harmonia.
}
%date 2026-08-15
